<p>To My Fellow Shareholders:</p>
<p>I will no longer be writing Berkshire’s annual report or talking endlessly at the annual meeting. As the British would say, I’m “going quiet.”</p>
<p>Sort of.</p>
<p>Greg Abel will become the boss at yearend. He is a great manager, a tireless worker and an honest communicator. Wish him an extended tenure.</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>